WEBVTT

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:08.070
SILVER <b>Shooting Star Silver  </b>FANG

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:08.520
GINGA NAGAREBOSHI   GIN
SILVER <b>Shooting Star Silver  </b>FANG

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:13.820
SILVER <b>Shooting Star Silver  </b>FANG
GINGA NAGAREBOSHI   GIN
SILVER <b>Shooting Star Silver  </b>FANG

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:30.850
<i>Inside the Iga house,
Ben and the pack trample on poison nails.</i>

00:01:39.150 --> 00:01:43.280
<i>Akame, the ninja dogs
leader, departs with Silver-</i>

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:47.450
<i>- to retrieve antidote and rescue them.</i>

00:01:57.560 --> 00:01:58.930
<i>But there...</i>

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:02.370
<i>Koga's leader Kurojaki, lay in ambush!</i>

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:11.110
JUSTICE<i>!</i>  CONDITIONS FOR A LEADER

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:20.190
You walked right into the trap, Akame!
This is the end of the Iga clan!

00:02:21.690 --> 00:02:23.910
This was cowardly done, Kurojaki!

00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:25.680
Listen!

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:27.450
Get out of here!

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:28.650
Master!

00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:35.400
Whatever happens,
you must bring the herbs to the house.

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:39.440
That's the least
we can do for Ben!

00:02:39.460 --> 00:02:41.860
Run! I'll cover you!

00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:47.720
Here comes Akame from Iga!

00:02:57.230 --> 00:02:58.170
Don't panic!

00:02:58.350 --> 00:03:00.020
Ignore the others
and chase after Akame!

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:04.380
Now!

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:22.670
Master!

00:03:28.630 --> 00:03:32.050
Jinnai!
I can't abandon the Master!

00:03:34.010 --> 00:03:35.180
Let me go!

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:37.440
Don't be stupid, Kirikaze!

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:39.690
Are you disobeying the
orders of the Master?

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:41.190
But...!

00:03:42.010 --> 00:03:46.780
No matter what, you can't be
guided by emotions!

00:03:46.980 --> 00:03:48.780
The command of our
Master is absolute!

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:55.460
Master!

00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:10.590
Now you die!

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:12.390
You bastard, Kurojaki!

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:23.070
Wait!

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.820
Please, take my herbs!

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:29.670
Take care of Ben!

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:32.240
Are you going to refuse orders?

00:04:33.720 --> 00:04:36.910
I'm not an Iga dog!
I do what I want!

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:38.910
I'll save your Master!

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:41.920
<i>I'm counting on you, Silver.</i>

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:44.690
<i>We'll be back as soon as
we've left these herbs.</i>

00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:48.670
The final blow, Akame!
Ready to die?

00:04:49.910 --> 00:04:50.680
Stop there!

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:20.200
Kid, how dare you!?

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:24.210
Kill him!

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:26.710
Tear that kid apart at once!

00:05:40.470 --> 00:05:42.970
What a kid! With that little body...!

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:47.370
What are you doing?
After them! After them!

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:55.140
Be careful! Are you blind?

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:57.200
Pardon, we are in a rush!

00:05:57.400 --> 00:05:58.700
Forgive our rudeness.

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:01.450
<i>What's with them?</i>

00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:04.960
<i>Were they followed?</i>

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:06.880
Hey, you!

00:06:10.170 --> 00:06:11.920
Two white dogs ran past here.

00:06:12.130 --> 00:06:12.850
Which way?

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:15.920
Is that how you ask
a polite question?!

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:23.110
Damn you!
Don't mess with us!

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:28.100
Get the fuck away,
while I'm still holding back.

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:30.130
Or I will not forgive you.

00:06:30.230 --> 00:06:30.950
Let's go!

00:06:37.970 --> 00:06:38.900
Master!

00:06:40.180 --> 00:06:42.110
Master, you made it!

00:06:42.240 --> 00:06:43.620
Ben? Where's Ben?

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:45.820
Ben!

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:52.130
Ben...

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:57.630
How are you, Ben?

00:06:58.990 --> 00:07:00.390
What are you doing?

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:03.220
Let go! It's me, Akatora!

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:04.980
Silver...

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:09.220
Ben was the last one
to take the herbs.

00:07:12.130 --> 00:07:13.990
What is it, Ben?

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:16.680
He's hallucinating
because of the poison.

00:07:17.740 --> 00:07:19.160
Hallucinating from poison?

00:07:24.070 --> 00:07:24.120
Ben!

00:07:24.120 --> 00:07:24.160
Ben!
Ben!

00:07:24.160 --> 00:07:24.200
Ben!
Ben!
Ben!

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:25.770
Ben!
Ben!
Ben!
Ben!

00:07:25.770 --> 00:07:25.820
Ben!
Ben!
Ben!

00:07:25.820 --> 00:07:25.860
Ben!
Ben!

00:07:25.860 --> 00:07:25.900
Ben!

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:30.710
Akame! If Ben dies,
you will follow him!

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:31.630
Don't worry.

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:36.580
That he hallucinates now,
means that he will make it.

00:07:42.590 --> 00:07:43.890
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:46.770
<i>Because of late treatment of the
poison, and hallucinations...</i>

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:49.820
<i>Even if he survives, there
will always be a side effect.</i>

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:54.430
<i>And when he wakes up, he
may lose one of his five senses.</i>

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:58.450
If I spy on those
Koga dogs for Ben-

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:00.970
- he might let me
join the pack again...

00:08:05.700 --> 00:08:08.040
You are... John!

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:11.450
Hyena?
What are you doing here?

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:16.960
A slight misunderstanding
caused me to get kicked out.

00:08:17.750 --> 00:08:20.460
And why are you sneaking
around here then?

00:08:20.780 --> 00:08:26.200
No, I was going to
spy on the enemy...

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:28.120
The enemy?

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:31.170
Ninja dogs from Koga.
The black ones.

00:08:31.340 --> 00:08:35.130
I see.
It will be a great gift.

00:08:36.360 --> 00:08:38.860
Master!
We've gathered the males!

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:43.310
Are you ready?

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:44.030
Yes!

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:45.460
Wait, Akame!

00:08:48.870 --> 00:08:49.970
Ben!

00:08:53.870 --> 00:08:54.550
Ben...

00:08:55.550 --> 00:08:56.420
Are you alright?

00:08:56.580 --> 00:08:57.590
I'm okay.

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:01.680
As you can see...

00:09:04.430 --> 00:09:05.680
Ben, I'm relieved....

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:07.930
I was really worried!

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:11.940
Akame...

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:17.710
show us where the Koga dogs are,
so we can destroy those cannibals.

00:09:18.440 --> 00:09:22.570
Ben, you have nothing
to do with this feud.

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:23.990
Continue your journey...

00:09:24.140 --> 00:09:27.940
No, I can't forgive the cannibals!

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:34.460
If we wait any longer,
they will attack.

00:09:34.680 --> 00:09:37.960
<i>Ben, haven't you noticed yet...?</i>

00:09:56.730 --> 00:09:58.480
Ben! Where are you going?

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:07.440
Go ahead.
I'll catch up with you soon.

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:12.330
Kirikaze, you lead them.
I'm worried about Ben.

00:10:12.720 --> 00:10:14.330
Then we run!

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:18.710
Ben, as I thought...

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:20.410
What do you mean?

00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:23.870
Sorry, Ben.
I know what's happening.

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:28.220
It was my poison...

00:10:28.670 --> 00:10:30.020
So you knew, okay.…

00:10:30.680 --> 00:10:32.730
I thought it was the darkness.

00:10:32.930 --> 00:10:34.980
Cross, what is it?

00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:42.980
So I will go blind?

00:10:44.440 --> 00:10:45.860
<i>Ben blind?</i>

00:10:46.190 --> 00:10:49.240
Ben! Let me be your eyes.

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:53.240
Tell me anything.
My eyes are yours.

00:10:54.140 --> 00:10:55.990
Akame, I have a request.

00:10:56.020 --> 00:10:56.990
What's that?

00:10:57.640 --> 00:11:01.990
When I loose my sight,
I want to choose my successor.

00:11:02.490 --> 00:11:05.760
All of your males
could fit as a leader.

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:07.310
Maybe...

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:11.010
But it's not enough to
just be sharp and have strength.

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:12.010
But...

00:11:12.970 --> 00:11:19.270
A leader must be determined and
have a strong sense of justice.

00:11:19.520 --> 00:11:21.020
Is there anyone?

00:11:21.150 --> 00:11:22.520
There's only one...

00:11:22.590 --> 00:11:23.700
Silver!

00:11:43.920 --> 00:11:46.670
Time to attack the House of Iga!

00:11:48.170 --> 00:11:50.380
<i>Damn little bear dog!</i>

00:11:50.930 --> 00:11:53.430
That's Koga's leader, Kurojaki.

00:11:53.760 --> 00:11:56.930
Good! We take him down
and give him to Ben!

00:11:57.430 --> 00:11:58.680
Hey, John!

00:12:02.270 --> 00:12:03.270
What the hell?

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:08.480
Kurojaki!

00:12:08.730 --> 00:12:10.890
If you don't want to get hurt,
come down here peacefully.

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:12.280
What?

00:12:12.300 --> 00:12:14.180
I don't know who this idiot is.

00:12:14.180 --> 00:12:17.080
You can become a blood
sacrifice for the battle!

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:27.190
What happens?

00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:31.970
Leader! The Iga dogs and
their helpers is attacking!

00:12:31.990 --> 00:12:35.470
Their numbers are...
overwhelmingly dominant!

00:12:37.220 --> 00:12:37.980
No!

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:40.230
The battle is
not about numbers!

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:41.890
We have the advantage
of our own area!

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:42.920
Spread out!

00:12:42.930 --> 00:12:46.230
Kurojaki!
We challenge you, to a fair combat!

00:12:51.490 --> 00:12:52.740
On them!

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:05.420
Damn little dog...

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:09.420
Ben, move aside!

00:13:09.780 --> 00:13:10.680
Okay...!

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:12.680
Ben!?

00:13:13.280 --> 00:13:14.180
Ben!?

00:13:19.180 --> 00:13:21.630
Ben!? It's me, Smith!

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:23.940
What are you doing?
Get rid of 'em at once.

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:24.790
Now!

00:13:28.400 --> 00:13:29.400
Wait, Kurojaki!

00:13:34.270 --> 00:13:36.510
<i>Ha ha ha, the kid is chasing me.</i>

00:13:36.950 --> 00:13:38.200
Wait, Kurojaki!

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:40.450
Do you still run away?

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:42.620
<i>All right, let's go here.</i>

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:44.620
Kurojaki, prepare yourself!

00:13:47.910 --> 00:13:48.690
Mr. Akame!

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:50.810
Let me fight him!

00:13:51.340 --> 00:13:54.370
Silver, you can't beat him.
Leave it to me.

00:13:54.900 --> 00:13:55.770
Mr. Akame!

00:13:55.770 --> 00:14:00.560
I wanna see whether or
not I can live up to Ben's expectations!

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:03.600
Silver, so you heard...

00:14:06.310 --> 00:14:08.610
Okay, you're Ben's replacement!

00:14:08.640 --> 00:14:12.350
I'll give this fight to you!
Do your best!

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:16.120
Come on, Kurojaki!

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:23.940
What are you doing here?

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:26.000
What does it look like?

00:14:29.650 --> 00:14:32.750
Unbelievable!
They are great males!

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:36.050
It's him!

00:14:38.970 --> 00:14:41.890
Excuse me for being late,
Platoon Leader! It's me, John!

00:14:42.470 --> 00:14:44.140
That voice...

00:14:46.230 --> 00:14:47.480
You're god, kid!

00:15:00.130 --> 00:15:01.080
Silver!

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:04.080
Damn!

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:06.460
There is no point in escaping!

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:08.210
Wait!

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:12.500
Kurojaki! Are you going
to abandon your own kid?

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:23.270
What are you doing
to my child?

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:27.510
So even demons
love their puppies?

00:15:31.300 --> 00:15:34.270
The pain in my heart
that I experienced...

00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:36.510
Now you will
taste it yourself!

00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:39.180
No, please stop!

00:15:42.560 --> 00:15:44.160
He's gonna kill it!

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:47.250
Beware!

00:15:57.050 --> 00:15:58.050
Cross!

00:16:15.020 --> 00:16:16.070
You!

00:16:16.190 --> 00:16:20.070
How dare you kill my child,
I will never forgive you!

00:16:31.110 --> 00:16:34.130
<i>Really strong. His strength
is not of an ordinary dog.</i>

00:16:41.300 --> 00:16:42.300
Don't run away!

00:16:42.500 --> 00:16:43.500
Fight!

00:16:43.600 --> 00:16:45.550
You're gonna die, kid!

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:12.880
Silver defeated Koga's leader!

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:15.210
What a crazy way to fight!

00:17:16.460 --> 00:17:18.210
An incredible kid.

00:17:18.710 --> 00:17:21.960
<i>Silver fits as a leader,
just as Ben says.</i>

00:17:23.820 --> 00:17:24.970
Silver! Beware!

00:17:28.350 --> 00:17:29.310
John!

00:17:29.340 --> 00:17:30.810
What are you doing here?

00:17:31.170 --> 00:17:32.060
It's been a while, Silver.

00:17:32.140 --> 00:17:34.210
We'll talk later...
Hurry and finish him!

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:38.370
Silver, you're the one
who defeated him!

00:17:38.390 --> 00:17:40.590
It is up to you if
he lives or die!

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:47.830
Wait!

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:52.830
He is a demon,
but he is still a parent.

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:57.330
Cross!
You're safe!

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:04.090
I'm a woman, after all.
I can handle sorrow and hate...

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:06.300
But not gnawing puppies.

00:18:11.910 --> 00:18:13.640
What will you do?

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:27.160
Kurojaki!

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:29.160
Go!

00:18:29.610 --> 00:18:33.460
Even as bad as you are,
you're still an irreplaceable father.

00:18:38.560 --> 00:18:39.670
Hurry, run away!

00:18:46.610 --> 00:18:47.430
That's right!

00:18:51.680 --> 00:18:53.060
As I thought.

00:18:53.580 --> 00:18:55.310
Let's catch him!

00:18:55.370 --> 00:18:56.310
Wait!

00:18:56.500 --> 00:19:01.310
We are here to gather males
to defeat Akakabuto!

00:19:01.460 --> 00:19:03.810
We have to avoid
unnecessary killings!

00:19:04.230 --> 00:19:08.320
Ben, it seems your
judgment was correct.

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:09.070
Yeah.

00:19:09.070 --> 00:19:12.320
Hyena!
Are you still here?

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:14.430
We warned you to
not come back!

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:15.280
Wait, wait, wait!

00:19:15.430 --> 00:19:19.560
He tried to find out what the enemy
was up to, and let you know.

00:19:19.730 --> 00:19:21.080
And who are you?

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:25.210
Akatora, it's my friend John!

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:26.960
I'll introduce you to everyone.

00:19:26.990 --> 00:19:30.210
But he has already
left the pack once!

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:31.720
That's right!

00:19:31.970 --> 00:19:34.470
However, I fought with the
Leader of Ou!

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:35.770
The Leader?

00:19:36.470 --> 00:19:38.770
And I lost for the
first time in my life!

00:19:38.790 --> 00:19:39.600
And...

00:19:40.020 --> 00:19:42.270
That's why I have
joined you again!

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:45.280
<i>John has fought the leader...?</i>

00:19:51.780 --> 00:19:53.530
I have a message!

00:19:54.510 --> 00:20:01.100
Akakabuto has placed one-armed
Mosa and other bears under him.

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:03.040
The day of the decisive
battle is near.

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:04.550
We have to hurry.

00:20:06.360 --> 00:20:08.440
It was the Leader's orders.

00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:12.550
So even Akakabuto recruits
soldiers, like we are...

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:14.300
Ben! Look over there!

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:17.060
It's the Iga House!

00:20:20.770 --> 00:20:21.560
Master!

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:26.560
Aren't all the old
documents in there?

00:20:27.370 --> 00:20:28.570
It's okay.

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:34.810
The lord of Iga is long time gone.
We have to end this conflict.

00:20:40.480 --> 00:20:42.470
Akame!

00:20:42.730 --> 00:20:45.050
What are you doing?

00:20:45.070 --> 00:20:47.330
Kurojaki!
Are you still here?

00:20:47.890 --> 00:20:48.810
Damn you!

00:20:49.300 --> 00:20:53.250
Are you burning down the house
because you are afraid I will take it?

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:56.510
No!
My role here, is over!

00:20:56.630 --> 00:20:57.400
Shut up!

00:20:57.520 --> 00:20:58.270
Shut up!

00:20:58.680 --> 00:21:02.850
It is our duty to obey and
follow orders of our Lord.

00:21:03.020 --> 00:21:05.570
Our lord is no longer here!

00:21:08.030 --> 00:21:11.950
Only the orders that have been
handed down by our ancestors remain.

00:21:12.130 --> 00:21:15.570
We don't need to
fight any more.

00:21:16.320 --> 00:21:18.330
Don't talk crap, Akame!

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:27.040
It's our responsibility to obtain this house from
ancestors and steal the book of secrets.

00:21:27.660 --> 00:21:31.050
My life is...
for this mission!

00:21:31.740 --> 00:21:33.680
Kurojaki!

00:21:39.260 --> 00:21:41.260
Leader!   Leader!   Leader!

00:21:41.700 --> 00:21:45.580
Kurojaki-sama!
Kurojaki-sama!
Kurojaki-sama!

00:21:47.150 --> 00:21:49.400
No!
Don't waste your lifes!

00:21:52.550 --> 00:21:57.400
<i>No! For what purpose?
Why are they rushing into death?</i>

00:21:58.860 --> 00:22:03.910
A ninja lives for his mission,
even if it leads to death.

00:22:05.050 --> 00:22:05.920
<i>Kurojaki...</i>

00:22:06.470 --> 00:22:09.160
<i>You were too faithful
to your mission...</i>

00:22:09.350 --> 00:22:11.510
<i>And a real ninja.</i>

00:22:11.700 --> 00:22:12.640
Farewell!

00:22:23.030 --> 00:22:24.030
Departure!

00:22:27.660 --> 00:22:34.690
